// Smash, the dragon warhammer's special attack (oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Dragon_warhammer).
//
// Thirty per cent of the target's CURRENT Defence, which is the part worth naming: the drain
// compounds rather than adds, so a second Smash takes 30% of what the first one left. Rounded
// down, as Old School rounds it - on a monster with three Defence that is nothing at all, and
// that is the rule rather than a case to round away.
^dwh_defence_drain_pct = 30
